  "body": "Synapse's response to a `/pushrules` query looks something like:\r\n\r\n```json5\r\n[\r\n  \"global\": {\r\n    \"content\": { /*... */ },\r\n    \"override\": { /*... */ },\r\n    \"room\": { /*... */ },\r\n    \"sender\": { /*... */ },\r\n    \"underride\": { /*... */ }\r\n  },\r\n  \"device\": {}\r\n]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis `device` property is not [specced](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.2/client-server-api/#get_matrixclientv3pushrules) and should be removed.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
